      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez nacieron dos gemelos: Brote, el tranquilo, y Pedernal, el filoso.",
          "en": "Last time, two twins were born: calm Sapling, and sharp Flint."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ahora ya eran grandes, y la tierra nueva todavía estaba vacía y en silencio.",
          "en": "Now they were grown, and the new land was still empty and quiet."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que cada uno empezó a darle forma al mundo, a su manera.",
          "en": "So each of them began to shape the world, in his own way."
        }
