      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Brote hizo los animales: el ciervo, el oso, el lobo y las aves del cielo.",
          "en": "Sapling made the animals: the deer, the bear, the wolf, and the birds of the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Pedernal los llamó a todos dentro de una cueva grande, en una montaña, y la tapó con una roca.",
          "en": "But Flint called them all into a big cave inside a mountain, and closed it with a rock."
        },
        {
          "es": "Quería tenerlos solo para él, para no tener que salir a cazar.",
          "en": "He wanted to keep them for himself, so he would never have to go out hunting."
        }
