      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al final, en muchas versiones, Brote moldeó a las personas con barro, y les dio vida.",
          "en": "Last of all, in many tellings, Sapling shaped people out of clay, and gave them life."
        },
        {
          "es": "Les mostró las plantas buenas para comer, y los animales del bosque.",
          "en": "He showed them the good plants to eat, and the animals of the forest."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pedernal miraba de lejos. Le daba envidia todo lo que hacía su hermano.",
          "en": "Flint watched from far away. He was jealous of everything his brother made."
        }
