      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Por fin, los gemelos se enfrentaron para decidir quién mandaría sobre el mundo.",
          "en": "At last, the twins faced each other, to decide who would rule the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pelearon mucho tiempo, de un lado al otro de la tierra.",
          "en": "They fought for a long time, from one end of the land to the other."
        },
        {
          "es": "En una versión mohawk, Brote encontró en el bosque un asta de ciervo caída, y con ella ganó la pelea.",
          "en": "In one Mohawk telling, Sapling found a deer antler lying in the forest, and with it he won the fight."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pedernal quedó vencido. Pero no podía morir: era parte del mundo mismo.",
          "en": "Flint was beaten. But he could not die. He was part of the world itself."
        }
      ],
